WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The team draws the chip’s connections.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
The factory specifies how much space it needs between them.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The layout is adjusted to meet the process rules.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
The layout already shows where each connection will go.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
A mask carries the pattern for one of the layers.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The machine will use this pattern to expose the wafer.
